• Develop scripts for the automation of tasks for SharePoint Online (PnP) and SharePoint Server 2016/2019 (PowerShell) deployments;

• Provide web application development support;

• Provide detailed documentation of changes and manage version control with the available systems (Git/GitLab);

• Provide SharePoint knowledge transfer to Client’s technical support personnel;

• Apply software development best practices;

• Perform other duties as required;

